              "instruction": "selavullō mēmu mēnamāma iṇṭiki veḷḷāmu. — In the holidays we went to our maternal uncle's house.",
              "spoken": true,
              "scored": false,
              "responseSeconds": 8,
              "source": "[YOU SAY: *selavullō mēmu mēnamāma iṇṭiki veḷḷāmu.* — In the holidays we went to our maternal uncle's house.]"
