          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "మేనత్త (mēnatta) joins native atta, \"mother-in-law, father's sister\" (DEDR 142), to mēna-, from DEDR's appendix of Indo-Aryan loans (DEDR App. 53)."
